<title>GERMANY: Italy has most air cargo agents in Europe.</title>
<headline>Italy has most air cargo agents in Europe.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy has the largest number of official International Air Transport Association (IATA) cargo agents in Europe ahead of Britain and Germany, IATA figures showed.</p>
<p>The number of accredited cargo agents has grown in all of the largest five European air cargo markets over the last half-year, figures released by IATA's Cargo Accounts Settlement System (CASS) in Germany said.</p>
<p>CASS is the official IATA accounting system between airlines and cargo agents.</p>
<p>The following table shows accredited IATA cargo agents by country:</p>
<p>  EUROPE    Agents    Agents</p>
<p>		(04/97)   (12/96)</p>
<p>  Italy     258	 222</p>
<p>  Britain   255	 236</p>
<p>  Germany   217	 197</p>
<p>  France    197	 181</p>
<p>  Spain     172	 146</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
